      "text": "def merge_sort(values):\n    if len(values) <= 1:\n        return values\n    middle = len(values) // 2\n    left = merge_sort(values[:middle])\n    right = merge_sort(values[middle:])\n    merged = []\n    i = j = 0\n    while i < len(left) and j < len(right):\n        if left[i] <= right[j]:\n            merged.append(left[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            merged.append(right[j])\n            j += 1\n    merged.extend(left[i:])\n    merged.extend(right[j:])\n    return merged\n",
